{"adjusted_val_bpb": 0.35796766124878376, "attempt": 0, "charged": true, "critic": {"issues": ["Only 2 runs per side; z~1.7 is a weak margin given the stated per-run noise sd of 0.0037, so the ~0.006 gain is not firmly established.", "The expanded feature matrix (MACCS + Morgan feature-counts) is passed only to LightGBM; the SVR branch and the std/QuantileTransformer step still use the original Xtr. This appears intentional but is easy to misread as an oversight.", "extra_fps() is called twice per fit and rebuilds the Morgan generator on every call; harmless but mildly wasteful. No MolFromSmiles None-check, so a bad SMILES would raise rather than degrade gracefully."], "ok": true, "veto": false}, "decision": "accept", "description": "Give LightGBM only extra features (167 MACCS keys plus 512-bit feature-invariant Morgan count fingerprints, radius 2) concatenated to the RDKit descriptors, while the SVR blend member keeps the quantile-normalized descriptors only and the 50/50 blend is unchanged.", "edit_class": "structural", "flags": [], "gpu": "willow", "idea_id": "b009", "incumbent_after": {"mean": 0.36527898176320217, "n": 2}, "incumbent_before": {"mean": 0.36527898176320217, "n": 2}, "job_id": "B2_caco_SS_2_s0-replicate-5_1795059399447", "kind": "replicate", "lint": {"hard": [], "ok": true, "warnings": []}, "model_calls": [{"cost_usd_nominal": 0.05672390000000001, "cost_usd_plan": 0.05672390000000001, "latency_s": 19.959019812988117, "requested_model": "opus", "role": "critic", "served_model": "opus", "tokens_in": 6463, "tokens_out": 1174}], "official_val_bpb": 0.35796766124878376, "sealed_val_bpb": null, "slot": 5, "status": "ok", "ts": "2026-11-19T03:39:00+00:00", "z1": 1.16977584882002, "z2": 1.6978340279674187}
